  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat(cli): autosdk skill emits multifile bundle by default 2026-04-18\n- feat(cli): add `autosdk skill` command to generate Claude SKILL.md 2026-04-18\n- feat: add opt-in microsoft extensions integrations 2026-04-17\n- [codex] Generate SDK snippets from OpenAPI examples (#265) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] generate polling helpers from vendor metadata (#269) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] Add first-class idempotency header support (#266) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] support scoped OpenAPI servers (v3) (#272) 2026-04-10\n- [codex] Support remaining official security schemes (#257) 2026-04-10\n- [codex] Support callbacks, webhooks, and links in HTTP artifacts (#251) 2026-04-10\n- feat(csharp): add generated sdk hooks (#268) 2026-04-09\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix(asyncapi): avoid duplicate subprotocol locals 2026-04-18\n- fix: add asyncapi websocket subprotocol auth 2026-04-17\n- fix: score nested anyof envelope properties 2026-04-17\n- fix: add websocket binary payload helpers 2026-04-17\n- fix: add typed asyncapi websocket connect parameters 2026-04-17\n- fix: handle fragmented websocket receive messages 2026-04-17\n- fix: support oauth auth constructors and snippets 2026-04-14\n- fix(cli): avoid snippet manifest crash for excluded deprecated operations (#275) 2026-04-14\n- [codex] Generate SDK snippets from OpenAPI examples (#265) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] generate polling helpers from vendor metadata (#269) 2026-04-11",
